flowchart TD
    Start([Founder Describes Idea in Plain English]) --> Refine[Call POST /ideas/refine]
    Refine --> Checklist[Founder Reviews & Edits Checklist<br/>- Must-Have / Nice-to-Have<br/>- Keywords & Descriptions]
    Checklist --> Confirm{Founder Confirms & Hits Search}
    
    Confirm --> CacheCheck{Is Query in Cache?<br/>Matches Checklist Hash?}
    CacheCheck -- Yes --> ReturnCache[Load Cached Ranked Repositories]
    
    CacheCheck -- No --> Preprocess[NLP Preprocessing<br/>Tokenisation, Stop-words, Lemmatisation]
    Preprocess --> Synonym[Synonym Expansion via Thesaurus]
    Synonym --> QueryVec[Construct Weighted Query Vector]
    QueryVec --> CosineSim[Compute Cosine Similarity against TF-IDF Index]
    CosineSim --> TopK[Retrieve Top-K Candidate Stale Repositories]
    
    TopK --> AutoAnalyze[Job Runner Dispatches Background Analyses]
    
    subgraph MultiAgentAnalysis["Multi-Agent Viability Engine"]
        Scout[Scout Agent: Repo Health & Stale Confirmation]
        Structure[Structure Agent: Directory Layout & Architecture]
        Coverage[Coverage Agent: Match Features to Source Files]
        BugRisk[Bug Risk Agent: Static Linting & Commit Decay]
        Deps[Deps Agent: Outdated Packages & OSV Vulnerabilities]
        License[License Agent: SPDX Classification & Permissiveness]
        
        Scout --> Structure --> Coverage --> BugRisk --> Deps --> License
        License --> Verifier[Anti-Hallucination Verifier Agent<br/>Validate Real File Paths & Drop Phantom Claims]
        Verifier --> Scorer[Deterministic Scoring Engine<br/>Coverage % - Bug Penalty + Health Subscores]
        Scorer --> Planner[Revival Planner Agent<br/>Founder Brief, Gaps & Effort Estimation]
    end

    AutoAnalyze --> MultiAgentAnalysis
    ReturnCache --> Display
    MultiAgentAnalysis --> Ranker[Deterministic Ranking Service<br/>Rank = 0.40*Rel + 0.30*Cov + 0.30*Viab]
    
    Ranker --> DisqualifyCheck{Has NO_LICENSE or CRITICAL_VULN?}
    DisqualifyCheck -- Yes --> Disqualify[Disqualify from Best Match Hero Card]
    DisqualifyCheck -- No --> BestMatch[Select #1 Ranked as Best Match]
    
    Disqualify --> Alternatives[Assign to Alternatives or More Matches]
    BestMatch --> Display[Render Results Dashboard]
    Display --> Deliverables[Founder Outputs:<br/>1. Best Match Hero Card<br/>2. Two Alternative Cards<br/>3. Detailed 7-Tab Report<br/>4. Printable Founder Brief]
